# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SurfaceWatch
#
# There was no .gitignore in this tree, which meant .env — holding the JWT
# signing key and the database password — was committable. That is the first
# entry below and the reason this file exists.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Every level: the compose stack reads ./.env, and backend/.env exists for
# running the API directly on the host. The negation keeps the templates, which
# are meant to be tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
# Any .env.<thing>.example template — .env.prod.example and future siblings.
# The .env.* rule above would otherwise swallow them, and a deploy template
# that is not tracked is a template nobody deploying from a clone can see.
!.env.*.example
!**/.env.*.example

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Node / Next ------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
out/

# Netlify CLI state. Holds the linked site id and a local build cache; the
# linked-site record is per-developer, not per-repo.
.netlify/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# --- Runtime state ----------------------------------------------------------
# Generated PDF/CSV/JSON reports. In the compose stack these live in a named
# volume, but a host-run backend writes them under the source tree.
reports/
*.log

# Database dumps. scripts/backup.sh defaults BACKUP_DIR to ./backups, so unless
# BACKUP_DIR is pointed elsewhere its output lands inside the repo. A dump holds
# every organisation, user (including password hashes), scan and finding — that
# is customer data, and it must never reach a commit.
backups/

# --- Editor / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
